OL,3,ASouthport attack victims, survivors and
OL,4,Afamilies hit by data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation is under way after a
OL,7,Fdata breach involving court files
OL,8,Frelating to victims, survivors and
OL,9,Ffamilies of the Southport attack, the
OL,10,FMinistry of Justice (MoJ) has said.
OL,12,FThe unauthorised access by courts staff
OL,13,Fwas identified during a review of the
OL,14,Fdepartment's digital systems. For a
OL,15,Flimited number of people, the
OL,16,Finformation accessed included sensitive
OL,17,Fand personal data, but the MOJ did not
OL,18,Fstate how many people were affected.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
