OL,3,ASouthport attack victims, survivors and
OL,4,Afamilies hit by data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn spokesperson said the MOJ was
OL,7,F"appalled", but there was no evidence
OL,8,Fpersonal data had been shared with
OL,9,Fthird parties and the Information
OL,10,FCommissioner's Office (ICO) had been
OL,11,Ftold.
OL,13,FThe prime minister has asked the Lord
OL,14,FChancellor to oversee the matter.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
